    {
      "beat_id": "BDEFS",
      "act": "DEFINITIONS",
      "lane": "CARD",
      "narration_text": "Four words before we start. Same-context review: asking a session to review the code it just wrote, without leaving that session. Clean-context review: a brand-new session, in a folder that has only the files — none of the conversation that produced them. Session: what claude -p starts. A new claude -p is a new session; that is a slash-clear. Resume: the flag that continues a session; the reviewer with that flag is the writer again.",
      "estimated_duration_s": 26.8,
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx",
